From: =?UTF-8?q?John=20T=C3=B6rnblom?= <john.tornblom@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 22:14:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/12] radv: let the winsys split long command streams

A winsys whose submissions are limited in size and may each start from
reset GPU state (the PS4's) can ask for a stream to be split before a
draw or dispatch (cs_split_due/cs_split). After the split, the command
buffer re-emits all its state. Splits are deferred while state that
can't be re-emitted is active (streamout, conditional rendering,
queries, inherited render passes).

Co-authored-by: Mihawk <163614687+mihawk-99@users.noreply.github.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
